            "stmt_text": "ctrl = devm_spi_alloc_host(&udev->dev, sizeof(struct ch341_spi_dev));",
            "location": "context",
            "explanation": "This statement allocates device-managed SPI controller resources using the parent USB device (&udev->dev) instead of the bound USB interface device (&intf->dev). When the driver is unbound, resources allocated against the interface device are properly released, but resources allocated against the parent USB device persist because the parent device remains bound even after the interface is unbound. This causes resource leaks during driver unbind operations."
          },
